Neelam earned her master’s degree from S. S. Jain Subodh P. G.
College, Jaipur, where she honed her skills and developed a strong
foundation in organic chemistry. Her commitment to research
excellence and innovative catalyst design underscores her promising trajectory in the realm of organic chemistry.

