Heavy Metals and Microbiological Assessment of the Soil−Plant
System of Flooded Areas Applied on Chard (Beta vulgaris)
Josip Jurkovic ́,* Mersiha Alkic ́-Subašic ́, Emina Sijahovic ́, Hamdija Č ivic ́, and Fejzo Bašic ́
Cite This: ACS Omega 2025, 10, 61877−61890

