Tampons as a source of exposure to metal(loid)s
Jenni A. Shearstona,b,*, Kristen Upsonc, Milo Gordona, Vivian Doa, Olgica Balaca, Khue
Nguyend, Beizhan Yand, Marianthi-Anna Kioumourtzogloua, Kathrin Schillinga
